  "name": "hp-lethal",
  "why": "Deaths through `_onHp`: a lethal hit with a fresh latch, the timed revive, a hit exactly RARE_GUARD_MS after the `redeploy` moment (it shows), a low-health alert cancelled by a death inside its debounce, and pool reports while down (no gain moment).",
