  "stage_ignores": [
    {"what":"write:$PLAY,,4,6,VA86","at":"death_cancels_alert","why":"Harness timing: the stage sends the held low-health line at the crossing on its injected `sleep`, which is instant here; on the engine the killing hit lands inside the hold (HURT_DEBOUNCE) and cancels it, so the line never goes. The cancel itself is pinned in test_stage_mirror.py (`test_a_death_inside_the_debounce_hold_cancels_the_queued_low_health_write`)."},
    {"what":"write:$HLED,7,4,90","at":"death_cancels_alert","why":"Harness timing: the stage sends the held low-health line at the crossing on its injected `sleep`, which is instant here; on the engine the killing hit lands inside the hold (HURT_DEBOUNCE) and cancels it, so the line never goes. The cancel itself is pinned in test_stage_mirror.py (`test_a_death_inside_the_debounce_hold_cancels_the_queued_low_health_write`)."},
    {"what":"write:$HLED,6,2,120,120,10,2,*","at":"death_cancels_alert","why":"Headset paint timing: engine.js paints the respawn flash 1.0 s after `$SPAWN` (`_headsetDelayed`, a paint step pinned in test_stage_mirror.py KNOWN_UNMIRRORED); the stage paints it with the revive write, so the two `$HLED` frames land at different checkpoints. Display only: no sound and no game state."},
    {"what":"write:$HLED,9,0,,,10,,*","at":"death_cancels_alert","why":"Headset paint timing: engine.js paints the respawn flash 1.0 s after `$SPAWN` (`_headsetDelayed`, a paint step pinned in test_stage_mirror.py KNOWN_UNMIRRORED); the stage paints it with the revive write, so the two `$HLED` frames land at different checkpoints. Display only: no sound and no game state."},
    {"what":"write:$HLED,6,2,120,120,10,2,*","at":"revived","why":"Headset paint timing: engine.js paints the respawn flash 1.0 s after `$SPAWN` (`_headsetDelayed`, a paint step pinned in test_stage_mirror.py KNOWN_UNMIRRORED); the stage paints it with the revive write, so the two `$HLED` frames land at different checkpoints. Display only: no sound and no game state."},
    {"what":"write:$HLED,9,0,,,10,,*","at":"revived","why":"Headset paint timing: engine.js paints the respawn flash 1.0 s after `$SPAWN` (`_headsetDelayed`, a paint step pinned in test_stage_mirror.py KNOWN_UNMIRRORED); the stage paints it with the revive write, so the two `$HLED` frames land at different checkpoints. Display only: no sound and no game state."},
    {"what":"write:$HLOOP,1,","why":"Harness timing: the down rearm waits 2.5 s on the stage's instant `sleep` but on the engine's clock (both use `rearm_after_ms`), so it lands at a different checkpoint."},
    {"what":"write:$IRTX","why":"DIVERGENCE: the stage does not model the S57 IR callouts. A dying engine sends the kill-confirm and DOWN words over `$IRTX` from inside `_death` (engine.js, the `S57 IR callout` write); the stage sends nothing."},
    {"what":"write:$GLED","why":"Harness timing: the stage's gun-body readout animation runs on its injected `sleep`, which is instant in this runner, while the engine's runs on its tick clock, so the same frames land at different checkpoints."},
    {"what":"state.moment","why":"The stage has no HUD moment slot to expose as state (its `_moment` is an internal gate); the HUD reads the engine's."},
    {"what":"state.deaths","why":"The stage keeps no death count (MC and the HUD read the engine's); `alive` is compared instead."},
    {"what":"state.phase","why":"The stage has no MC link, so it has no match phase; it is armed and spawned by its own buttons."}
  ],
